WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:01.340
- Hey guy, how's it going?

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:03.210
It's Justine and guess
where we are right now,

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:05.240
we are in Seattle and
right now in front of me

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:06.970
is an old Apple store,

00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:08.890
because behind me is a brand
new one that is opening

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:10.980
in University Village, here in Seattle.

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:13.560
Because this store was
opened in September in 2003,

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:15.100
which was before the iPhone,

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:16.370
which is kind of crazy to think,

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:18.230
there was a time before the iPhone.

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:20.550
So I look forward to the grand
opening of this tomorrow.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:22.280
Oh my gosh people are clapping.

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:23.580
Sorry now all of the employees are waiting

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.960
for the last customer in
this Apple store to come out

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:26.920
and they're going to clap for him.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.210
He's at the Genius bar right now,

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:29.450
and he has no idea what's

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:30.570
going to happen.

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:35.570
(crowd cheering)
(crowd clapping)

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:40.996
Definitely was focused on the
wrong guy leaving the store.

00:00:40.996 --> 00:00:41.829
(speaker laughing)

00:00:41.829 --> 00:00:43.563
So I don't even think I captured it.

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:48.060
This is the brand new store
that will be opening up

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:51.020
tomorrow morning, 9:30 AM.

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:53.482
Grand opening, baby.

00:00:53.482 --> 00:00:56.982
(mysterious techno music)

00:01:38.462 --> 00:01:40.999
The store looks amazing.

00:01:40.999 --> 00:01:42.249
Oh my goodness!

00:01:43.356 --> 00:01:45.290
It looks so good, I can't wait.

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:50.074
Hey Jen, is that a Ronin-S?

00:01:50.074 --> 00:01:52.430
- [Jen] Are you a Ronin-S
or you just gonna, suh.

00:01:52.430 --> 00:01:53.263
- Suh.

00:01:53.263 --> 00:01:56.263
(speakers laughing)

00:01:58.569 --> 00:02:02.069
(mysterious techno music)

